{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"],"title":"Type Methods"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what they set:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey"},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Sampler.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28"},"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","title":"Sampler"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SampleRateKey":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SampleRateKey","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key of the rate a record was kept at, which a tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s set on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the context of every record they keep.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SampleRateKey","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampleratekey","title":"SampleRateKey","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler/events(where:rate:)":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"events"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rate"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SampleRate","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers10SampleRateV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sampler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler\/events(where:rate:)","title":"events(where:rate:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A sampler that keeps each record ","type":"text"},{"code":"selects","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for with probability ","type":"text"},{"code":"rate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deciding each on its own.","type":"text